+                    "not enough cores on node ["
+                        + node.id()
+                        + "] to assign ["
+                        + allocations
+                        + "] allocations to model ["
+                        + model.id()
+                        + "]; required threads per allocation ["
+                        + model.threadsPerAllocation()
+                        + "]"
